config RTL8188EUS
	tristate "Realtek RTL8188EUS USB (aircrack-ng driver, monitor mode and injection)"
	depends on CFG80211 && USB
	select WIRELESS_EXT
	select WEXT_PRIV
	help
	  Realtek's own driver for the RTL8188EUS / RTL8188ETV, as carried by
	  aircrack-ng (github.com/aircrack-ng/rtl8188eus). This is the chip
	  in the TP-Link TL-WN722N v2 and v3.

	  rtl8xxxu also claims this chip, but it only associates: it does
	  not set the chip up for monitor mode beyond mac80211's filter
	  flags and has no transmit path for injected frames. This driver
	  does both. With it enabled, rtl8xxxu leaves the RTL8188EU alone.
